3
00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:59,140
This girl's all grown up now.

4
00:01:25,620 --> 00:01:26,540
They've all grown up.

5
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:29,219
This trip wasn't for nothing.

6
00:02:25,439 --> 00:02:25,939
Master?

7
00:02:26,639 --> 00:02:27,240
Where'd he go?

8
