9
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,560
You sure have grown up.

10
00:03:13,639 --> 00:03:14,580
Too bad.

11
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:17,139
Still just a bit short.

12
00:03:18,180 --> 00:03:21,319
