13
00:03:24,060 --> 00:03:25,900
Almost.

14
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,280
Almost.

15
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:38,360
Almost.

16
00:03:38,419 --> 00:03:39,419
Old He!

17
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:40,620
Go to hell!

18
00:03:45,439 --> 00:03:47,180
Where's Yan'er? I'll kill you!

19
00:03:49,159 --> 00:03:50,479
Those little games between you two...

20
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:52,680
Did you really take me for a fool?

21
00:03:53,599 --> 00:03:56,240
A bastard and a whore!

22
00:03:56,819 --> 00:03:58,479
