23
00:04:17,540 --> 00:04:18,779
Haizhu, wake up.

24
00:04:21,259 --> 00:04:21,779
Haizhu!

25
00:04:22,259 --> 00:04:23,060
Wake up!

26
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,459
Haizhu, wake up!

27
00:04:26,939 --> 00:04:27,879
Haizhu, wake up!

28
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,220
