Just go!

36
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,339
Go! Stay back!

37
00:05:10,699 --> 00:05:11,660
Don't come any closer!

38
00:05:13,399 --> 00:05:15,339
Liu Haizhu!

39
00:05:16,259 --> 00:05:16,720
Right?

40
