You're next.

41
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:30,420
Stop!

42
00:05:31,620 --> 00:05:32,279
Zhou Meng!

43
00:05:46,439 --> 00:05:47,060
Haizhu!

44
00:07:02,620 --> 00:07:03,139
Haizhu.

45
00:07:12,980 --> 00:07:13,500
Zhou Meng...

46
00:07:15,420 --> 00:07:16,060
Zhou Meng.

47
00:07:20,060 --> 00:07:21,180
She's such a good girl.

48
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,100
I'll send you to join her.

49
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,019
Don't move!

50
00:11:35,919 --> 00:11:37,120
Drop your weapons!

51
00:11:50,860 --> 00:11:53,500
