53
00:11:56,759 --> 00:11:59,159
A pillar of fire, right in the center,

54
00:11:59,399 --> 00:12:01,860
lighting up every corner bright.

55
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:04,580
Warm or scorching, none dare touch.

56
00:12:04,759 --> 00:12:07,200
Blessing or curse, time will tell.

57
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:08,080
Off we go, off we go.

58
00:12:10,679 --> 00:12:11,860
