70
00:12:53,559 --> 00:12:54,399
Pumping air's free.

71
00:12:56,120 --> 00:12:56,639
Alright.

72
00:13:00,820 --> 00:13:01,519
See ya, Zhuzi.

73
00:13:06,639 --> 00:13:07,159
