79
00:13:53,899 --> 00:13:54,899
This great hero,

80
00:13:55,639 --> 00:13:56,919
skilled in martial arts since childhood,

81
00:13:57,559 --> 00:13:58,299
despised evil with a passion.

82
00:13:59,759 --> 00:14:00,480
Then one day,

